      "source": "Creates a new <a href=\"SpelCriteria.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>SpelCriteria</code></a> for the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a>.",
      "translation": "为给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"类或接口 org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> 创建一个新的 <a href=\"SpelCriteria.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core 中的类\"><code>SpelCriteria</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Creates new <a href=\"SpelCriteria.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>SpelCriteria</code></a>.",
      "translation": "创建新的<a href=\"SpelCriteria.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core 中的类\"><code>SpelCriteria</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>expression</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>expression</code> 不得为 null。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "will never be null.",
      "translation": "永远不会为 null。",
