    {
      "source": "<a href=\"SpelCriteria.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>SpelCriteria</code></a> allows to pass on a <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> and <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> to the actual query\nprocessor. This decouples the <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> from the context it is used in.",
      "translation": "<a href=\"SpelCriteria.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.keyvalue.core\"><code>SpelCriteria</code></a> 允许将 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> 和 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/EvaluationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression\"><code>EvaluationContext</code></a> 传递给实际的查询处理器。这使得 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/expression/spel/standard/SpelExpression.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.expression.spel.standard\"><code>SpelExpression</code></a> 与其使用上下文解耦。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "<code>context</code> - must not be null.",
      "translation": "<code>context</code> 不能为 null。",
      "count": 1
    },
